{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "class InputString:\n    def __init__(self, value: str):\n        self.value = value\n\nclass SubstringCounter:\n    target: str = \"std\"\n    def __init__(self):\n        pass\n    def countOccurrences(self, input_obj: InputString) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Return the number of occurrences of self.target in input_obj.value as int.\"\"\"\n        return input_obj.value.count(self.target)\n\ndef count_occurance(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Public API: accepts a single string argument and returns int.\"\"\"\n    inp = InputString(s)\n    counter = SubstringCounter()\n    return counter.countOccurrences(inp)"}
