{"task_id": "Mbpp/227", "solution": "class ComparisonEngine:\n    def computeMin(self, a, b, c):\n        \"\"\"Return the numeric minimum of a, b, c using comparisons.\"\"\"\n        minimum = a\n        if b < minimum:\n            minimum = b\n        if c < minimum:\n            minimum = c\n        return minimum\n\ndef min_of_three(a, b, c):\n    \"\"\"Return the smallest numeric value among a, b, c.\"\"\"\n    engine = ComparisonEngine()\n    return engine.computeMin(a, b, c)"}
